title: LO
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: lo_relations_timer <= 0
max-visits: 36
frequency: 300
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; lo_relations_timer += 7;
card-image: img/overenskomst.jpg
tags: workers_movement

= **LO**

We are institutionally {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Our party and the trade union confederation was born as twins, originally united in a single organisation. For practical reasons this unity was dissolved, nonetheless we still appoint two members to their central comittee, and they still appoint two to ours.">welded with LO</span>!}, giving us many opportunities to coordinate our strategy.

LO currently gives us [+ income_lo +] resources a month, and our relations with its leadership are [+ lo_relations : lo_relations +].

- @transfer_funds: Tell them we won't be needing their entire contribution.
- @promise_reform: Promise reforms to the labour market.
- @discuss_next_election: Plan the next campaign together.
- @easy_discard

@transfer_funds
subtitle: -1 LO income a month, but LO will remember the gesture.
choose-if: income_lo >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: LO is not giving us anything to hand back.
on-arrival: income_lo -= 1; lo_relations += 7

The LO leadership appreciates this gesture, and promises to make it up to us.

@promise_reform
subtitle: LO will be pleased, but Radikale and our technocrats will not.
view-if: LO_reform_promised = 0
on-arrival: LO_reform_promised = 1; lo_relations += 7; b_relation -= 3; technocrat_dissent += 2

We promise LO reforms to the labour market[? if a_in_government = 0 : once we are back in power?]. The LO leadership is pleased. Radikale Venstre is not, and some of our own economists warn that we have tied our hands.

@discuss_next_election
subtitle: The unions will mobilise their members for us, but LO expects something in return.
choose-if: lo_relations >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with LO are not good enough for them to campaign with us.
on-arrival: prole_a += 2*efc; public_prole_a += 2*efc; a_activity += 3; lo_relations -= 3

We draw up plans with LO for joint meetings and workplace campaigns. Shop stewards across the country will hand out our leaflets at the next election.
